{title: Yeh Hai Reshami Zulfon Ka Andhera}
{artist: Asha Bhosle O P Nayyar}
{key: C#m}

{c: Verse 1}
[C#m]Yeh Hai Reshmi Zulfon Ka andhera
[B]na ghabraiye
[F#]Jahan tak mahak hai mere
[E]gesuon ki [C#m]chalye aiye
[C#m]Suniye to zara jo haquiqat hai
[B]kahte hain hum
[B]Khulte rukte in
[C#m]rangeen labon ki kasam
[F#]Jal uthenge [E]diye jugnuo [F#]ki tarah
[C#m]Ji tabassum to farmaiye
[C#m]La la la la...
[B]La la la la...
[F#]La la la la...
[C#m]La la la la...
[C#m]Pyasi hai nazar ye bhi kahne ki
[B]hai baat kya
[B]Tum ho mehman to na
[C#m]thehregi yeh raat kya
[F#]Raate jaye [E]rahi aap [F#]dil mai mere
[C#m]Arma ban ke rah jayiye
